    "original": {
      "label": "原文",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Release: llm-anthropic 0.31",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "bold": true,
              "text": "Release:"
            },
            {
              "text": " "
            },
            {
              "href": "https://github.com/simonw/llm-anthropic/releases/tag/0.31",
              "text": "llm-anthropic 0.31"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Anthropic released Fable 5.2 and Mythos 5.2 today. Fable 5.2 is currently ranked first on Artificial Analysis. Anthropic say it \"solved two open problems in the physics of black holes\", so clearly their internal benchmarks have become more ambitious!",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "Anthropic "
            },
            {
              "href": "https://www.anthropic.com/claude-fable-and-mythos-5-2",
              "text": "released Fable 5.2 and Mythos 5.2"
            },
            {
              "text": " today. Fable 5.2 is currently "
            },
            {
              "href": "https://artificialanalysis.ai/models/claude-fable-5-2",
              "text": "ranked first on Artificial Analysis"
            },
            {
              "text": ". Anthropic say it \"solved two open problems in the physics of black holes\", so clearly their internal benchmarks have become more ambitious!"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "I've added the new models to llm-anthropic, so you can now run prompts through Fable 5.2 like this:",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "I've added the new models to "
            },
            {
              "code": true,
              "text": "llm-anthropic"
            },
            {
              "text": ", so you can now run prompts through Fable 5.2 like this:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "text": "uv tool install llm\nllm install llm-anthropic\nllm keys set anthropic\n# paste key here\nllm -m claude-fable-5.2 \"Generate an SVG of a pelican riding a bicycle\"\n"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "I ran pelicans at all five reasoning levels - low, medium, high, xhigh, and max. You can see them all here - here's the best result I got, from xhigh:",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "I ran pelicans at all five reasoning levels - "
            },
            {
              "code": true,
              "text": "low"
            },
            {
              "text": ", "
            },
            {
              "code": true,
              "text": "medium"
            },
            {
              "text": ", "
            },
            {
              "code": true,
              "text": "high"
            },
            {
              "text": ", "
            },
            {
              "code": true,
              "text": "xhigh"
            },
            {
              "text": ", and "
            },
            {
              "code": true,
              "text": "max"
            },
            {
              "text": ". You can "
            },
            {
              "href": "https://tools.simonwillison.net/markdown-svg-renderer?url=https%3A%2F%2Fgist.github.com%2Fsimonw%2Fbcd1a1bf38b929b0bbbae2e38b808e97",
              "text": "see them all here"
            },
            {
              "text": " - here's the best result I got, from "
            },
            {
              "code": true,
              "text": "xhigh"
            },
            {
              "text": ":"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "aihot/media/b80871d297facae7fb72743bf9e60bc382511c25920ffbf84c69f6faa9e63c4f.jpg",
          "alt": "It's good - legs the right side of the bicycle, good frame, nice pouch, weird little fingers on the handlebars. The pouch looks slightly misaligned with the top of the beak."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "max failed to return an image at all, running out of tokens after spending 128,000 thinking about them. That's the same bug that I saw with Opus 5.5 - but it's new for the Fable series, both Fable 5 and Fable 5.1 returned max effort pelicans just fine.",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "code": true,
              "text": "max"
            },
            {
              "text": " failed to return an image at all, running out of tokens after spending 128,000 "
            },
            {
              "href": "https://tools.simonwillison.net/markdown-svg-renderer?url=https%3A%2F%2Fgist.github.com%2Fsimonw%2Fbcd1a1bf38b929b0bbbae2e38b808e97#reasoning-2",
              "text": "thinking about them"
            },
            {
              "text": ". That's the same bug that I saw with "
            },
            {
              "href": "https://simonwillison.net/2026/Sep/22/opus-and-sol-and-luna/#claude-opus-5-5-max-over-thinks-to-the-point-of-breaking",
              "text": "Opus 5.5"
            },
            {
              "text": " - but it's new for the Fable series, both "
            },
            {
              "href": "https://simonwillison.net/2026/Jun/9/claude-fable-5/#and-some-pelicans",
              "text": "Fable 5"
            },
            {
              "text": " and "
            },
            {
              "href": "https://simonwillison.net/2026/Sep/1/claude-fable-5-1/#max",
              "text": "Fable 5.1"
            },
            {
              "text": " returned max effort pelicans just fine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "It's priced at $8/million input and $40/million output, which is a 20% discount on the previous Fable 5.1 ($10/$50).",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "It's priced at $8/million input and $40/million output, which is a 20% discount on the previous Fable 5.1 ($10/$50)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
